Licensing by component / 按模块适用许可

This repository contains independently licensed components. The licenses are
not interchangeable options for the same code.

- mods/smtvv/: MIT. See LICENSE-MIT and the applicable third-party notices.
- mods/p5r/first-person/: GPL-3.0-or-later. See its LICENSE and
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. LICENSE-GPL-3.0 is a root-level copy of the GPL text.
- Other original repository files: MIT unless explicitly stated otherwise.
- Third-party code retains its own copyright notices and license terms.

The MIT license does not replace or override the P5R module's GPL terms.
Redistributed P5R builds include a separate corresponding-source archive.

本仓库按模块分别授权，不是同一份代码可以任选 MIT 或 GPL。
SMTVV 模块采用 MIT；P5R 第一人称模块采用 GPL-3.0-or-later。
其他原创仓库文件未另行声明时采用 MIT，第三方内容遵循各自许可。
MIT 不覆盖 P5R 的 GPL 条款。P5R 发布包另附对应源码。
